    content: "<p><strong>One name on the marquee. 6 specialists behind the build.</strong></p>\n<p>You know Wynn Las Vegas. You might know the operator \u2014 <strong>Wynn Resorts</strong>. But Wynn Las Vegas is not one company&rsquo;s product; it is an assembled system. Each system slot below is a different brand&rsquo;s specialty \u2014 <strong>every line backed by a published source</strong>.</p>\n<h2>Who Built Wynn Las Vegas? Who Owns It?</h2>\n<p><strong>Who built Wynn Las Vegas?</strong> The main contractor was <strong>Marnell Corrao Associates</strong> (for Wynn Las Vegas resort and Lake of Dreams theatrical construction). <strong>Who owns Wynn Las Vegas?</strong> The marquee name and operator is <strong>Wynn Resorts</strong>.</p>\n<p>That is the short version, and it is also why the question is worth asking twice. A project this size is not one company&rsquo;s work: <strong>6 separate system slots</strong> below are each held by a different named supplier &mdash; elevators, facade, structure, cooling, sound &mdash; and every one of them is backed by a published source you can open. The contractor gets the credit; the building is an assembly.</p>\n<h2>The build, slot by slot</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>System slot</th><th>Supplier</th><th>Role</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Architectural &amp; Show Lighting</td><td><strong>Color Kinetics</strong></td><td>Lake of Dreams LED lighting</td><td><a href=\"https://www.colorkinetics.com/global/showcase/wynn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Commercial HVAC Solutions</td><td><strong>Hansen Mechanical</strong></td><td>mechanical contractor for resort tower and Lake of Dreams mountain feature</td><td><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>General Contracting / Construction Management</td><td><strong>Marnell Corrao Associates</strong></td><td>general contractor for Wynn Las Vegas resort and Lake of Dreams theatrical construction</td><td><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Professional Sound Reinforcement</td><td><strong>Signal Perfection Limited</strong></td><td>Lake of Dreams theatrical audio system integrator</td><td><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Show Control Systems</td><td><strong>Big Show</strong></td><td>hydraulics, stage machinery, show control</td><td><a href=\"https://bigshowcm.com/portfolio/wynn-las-vegas-the-vision-for-lake-of-dreams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>digital cinema projection</td><td><strong>Barco</strong></td><td>Lake of Dreams theatrical projectors</td><td><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>In their own words</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Color Kinetics</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;More than 4,000 individually controlled Color Kinetics C-Splash 2 units are installed on 700 removable panels at the bottom of the lake&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Hansen Mechanical</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Mechanical Contractor \u2013 Hansen Mechanical&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Marnell Corrao Associates</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;General Contractor \u2013 Marnell Corrao Associates&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Signal Perfection Limited</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Audio System \u2013 Signal Perfection Limited&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Big Show</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Big Show developed the specifications for the hydraulics, stage machinery, fog &amp; mist effects, projection, robotics, show control&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Barco</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Projectors - Barco&rdquo;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why this matters</h2>\n<p>Famous places are <strong>one brand on the marquee, many brands behind the build</strong>. Diffr maps that hidden supply graph \u2014 every supplier and every venue is a brand, linked many-to-many, each link sourced. This is the B2B twin of <a href=\"/diffr/blog/the-decide-once-rule\">one brand per slot</a>.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<p><em>The supplier claims in the table above are indexed below \u2014 one reference per verified supplier&ndash;slot link in Diffr&rsquo;s graph. Retrieved 26 July 2026.</em></p>\n<ol class=\"references\" style=\"font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.55\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\" value=\"1\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Color Kinetics \u00b7 Architectural &amp; Show Lighting</strong>\n. Lake of Dreams LED lighting\n. <cite><a href=\"https://www.colorkinetics.com/global/showcase/wynn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">colorkinetics.com</a></cite>\n (Supplier official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;More than 4,000 individually controlled Color Kinetics C-Splash 2 units are installed on 700 removable panels at the bottom of the lake&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\" value=\"2\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Hansen Mechanical \u00b7 Commercial HVAC Solutions</strong>\n. mechanical contractor for resort tower and Lake of Dreams mountain feature\n. <cite><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">preview.thenewsmarket.com</a></cite>\n (Venue / operator official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;Mechanical Contractor \u2013 Hansen Mechanical&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\" value=\"3\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Marnell Corrao Associates \u00b7 General Contracting / Construction Management</strong>\n. general contractor for Wynn Las Vegas resort and Lake of Dreams theatrical construction\n. <cite><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">preview.thenewsmarket.com</a></cite>\n (Venue / operator official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;General Contractor \u2013 Marnell Corrao Associates&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\" value=\"4\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Signal Perfection Limited \u00b7 Professional Sound Reinforcement</strong>\n. Lake of Dreams theatrical audio system integrator\n. <cite><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">preview.thenewsmarket.com</a></cite>\n (Venue / operator official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;Audio System \u2013 Signal Perfection Limited&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\" value=\"5\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Big Show \u00b7 Show Control Systems</strong>\n. hydraulics, stage machinery, show control\n. <cite><a href=\"https://bigshowcm.com/portfolio/wynn-las-vegas-the-vision-for-lake-of-dreams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bigshowcm.com</a></cite>\n (Supplier official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;Big Show developed the specifications for the hydraulics, stage machinery, fog &amp; mist effects, projection, robotics, show control&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-6\" value=\"6\">\n<span class=\"reference-text\">\n<strong>Barco \u00b7 digital cinema projection</strong>\n. Lake of Dreams theatrical projectors\n. <cite><a href=\"https://preview.thenewsmarket.com/Previews/WYNN/DocumentAssets/279928_v2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">preview.thenewsmarket.com</a></cite>\n (Venue / operator official).\n Excerpt: &ldquo;Projectors - Barco&rdquo;\n</span></li>\n</ol>",
